\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LPzJNgka0_UQ7kNvwGSaC1t&_nc_oc=AdnJLfxeNTttSmjkt71akbQa2h5CTa7Tz7taiXwCNKmlG2-XtvQ4z2hEJqLTg5qV0U4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw2F_7RzEHZLcNJK6aMkLipf7gNQRTJ0zTjqsV8u6ISgA&oe=69B2A1F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U1AnCGn_wOsQ7kNvwEKAFVy&_nc_oc=AdkT9-NkOlF3WVjfsK0mCM9fiJ3rYIlDPbptODhKMTKuEFsb_2K7PVNwVHCnZeVgnUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx4oUljNH80iNZHxNkhpkHJuOch1Mp8u9UIxo94L5YXmg&oe=69B2A356"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7N2FdbbMHl8Q7kNvwGl2OmJ&_nc_oc=AdnQ7ClqNdEkbzAa_b33ZTe5CI4HU2kxAMcSQbQAj4rLtuvp8ZDVdN-7KQdJ0n8Xe4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfylImatmIBitA2O_U7FRkLlovnxkZuTY8mrCuGziDf0ww&oe=69B2B877"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771